class.description:
Player 1 is the signed-in player ([member player]). Others can join on the same device as guests: a plain guest whose progress the game keeps in player 1's save, a local profile remembered on this device with saves of its own, or a guest who brings their own profile with their email ([method invite_guest]), with their own account and saves.
[codeblock]
for guest in LocalPlayers.remembered:
add_button(guest.player_name)  # a "Who's playing?" picker
var guest = LocalPlayers.add_guest()
[/codeblock]
